# Coalition Relic: the counters are removed "from this artifact" as the trigger resolves. Turn 1 the Relic stores a charge
# counter. Turn 3, with its trigger on the stack, Bot1 destroys the Relic with Abrade: the Relic is gone and its counter
# with it (CR 400.7), so nothing was removed and no mana is added - no color is even asked for.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Coalition Relic
Abrade
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

